Package: foo
Version: 0.1.0
Title: Instrumented Probe Package for Mapping the Execution Surface
Description: Appends a marker line to the log named by the FOO_LOG environment
    variable each time one of its instrumented execution sites runs. Used by
    run_foo.sh to establish which lifecycle phase reaches which site.
